                                "sense_id": "4a33f4d8-602a-35a4-add9-d6dfe5673da1",
                                "text": "[…]but on the other hand the Idists are not so few as their adversaries generally say, and among them are a good many who before 1907 were leaders and editors of Esperanto in the various countries."
